  "12G-p05-Q7-1": {
   "steps": [
    {
     "text": "For f(x) = ax² + bx + c the vertex has x-coordinate −b/(2a). Test each option.",
     "latex": "x_v=-\\dfrac{b}{2a}"
    },
    {
     "text": "Option a): a = 1, b = −8.",
     "latex": "x_v=-\\dfrac{-8}{2(1)}=4\\ \\checkmark"
    },
    {
     "text": "Option b): x_v = −6/2 = −3. Option c): x_v = −(−4)/(2(−1)) = −2. Option d) is not a valid quadratic.",
     "latex": "x_v=-3,\\quad x_v=-2"
    },
    {
     "text": "Only option a) has its vertex at x = 4.",
     "latex": "f(x)=x^2-8x+15"
    }
   ],
   "verified": true
